        "committer": {
          "name": "Marc Vef",
          "email": "mvef@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-26 11:31:17.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 csdc: migrate to another compression level",
        "message": "LU-10026 csdc: migrate to another compression level\n\nHere is a test there lfs migrate with changed\ncompression level.\n\ntests: fix sanity-compr 1030\n\nSet compress_check_bytes to 2 times larger\nthan uncompressed file size. Without that\nfile might be considered incompressible.\n\nAdd extra debugging to help understand test failures.\n\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10512\nWas-Change-Id: I559f94b24bd2abb821a07775198bb4e511793a72\n\ntests: change algo in 1030\n\nto compare apples with apples. skip (i.e. do no fail) if\nless data were compressed in the 2nd approach as this may\nhappen due to external conditions we don't control well\n(grants, etc).\ntake into account that higher compression level in lz4fast\nmeans less efforts and larger result.\n\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10512\nWas-Change-Id: Ia4c655ec99c1b45ff9c273311e5d567b8201cd5a\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-9889\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <bzzz@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Artem Blagodarenko <ablagodarenko@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ia67316a247fed99f6ad002c8b67053a3c2fa0cff\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
